#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_database_prefix.php:32
msgid ""
"WordPress security is a serious matter and you can improve it by changing the WordPress database prefix. A WordPress database contains all of the information for your website, which makes it a prime target for hackers. \n"
"                                                                By default, the WordPress database prefix is “wp_” and is quite easy to locate and target."
msgstr ""
"La seguridad de WordPress es un asunto serio y puede mejorarla cambiando el prefijo de la base de datos de WordPress. Una base de datos de WordPress contiene toda la información de su sitio web, lo que la convierte en un objetivo principal para los hackers. \n"
"Por defecto, el prefijo de la base de datos de WordPress es \"wp_\" y es bastante fácil de localizar y atacar."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_database_prefix.php:46 include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_db_debug.php:48 include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_disable_file_edit.php:44 include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_wp_debug.php:46
