"                                                                        <br /><code>register_globals = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>php_flag register_globals off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>El register_globals está ACTIVADO.\n"
"Para solucionar este problema de seguridad, cambie el php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"<br /><code>register_globals = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"o dentro de .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"<br /><code>php_flag register_globals off</code>."

